===================================================================
HTTP/1.1 200 OK
Date: REGEX(.*)
Content-Type: application/json
Link: <https://uri.etsi.org/ngsi-ld/v1/ngsi-ld-core-context-v1.9.jsonld>; rel="http://www.w3.org/ns/json-ld#context"; type="application/ld+json"
Content-Length: 237

[
  {
    "id": "urn:V2",
    "speed": {
      "type": "Property",
      "value": 20
    },
    "type": "Vehicle"
  },
  {
    "id": "urn:V3",
    "speed": {
      "type": "Property",
      "value": 30
    },
    "type": "Vehicle"
  }
]



07. Reuse MODIFYING q (speed>25) — 400 (a bound filter may not be changed)
==========================================================================
HTTP/1.1 400 Bad Request
Date: REGEX(.*)
Content-Type: application/json
Content-Length: 227

{
  "detail": "URL parameter 'q' differs from the query that created entity map 'REGEX(.*)'",
  "status": 400,
  "title": "Bad Request",
  "type": "https://uri.etsi.org/ngsi-ld/errors/BadRequestData"
}



08. Reuse MODIFYING type (Car) — 400
====================================
HTTP/1.1 400 Bad Request
Date: REGEX(.*)
Content-Type: application/json
Content-Length: 230

{
  "detail": "URL parameter 'type' differs from the query that created entity map 'REGEX(.*)'",
  "status": 400,
  "title": "Bad Request",
  "type": "https://uri.etsi.org/ngsi-ld/errors/BadRequestData"
}



09. Reuse INTRODUCING scopeQ (not used at creation) — 400
=========================================================
HTTP/1.1 400 Bad Request
Date: REGEX(.*)
Content-Type: application/json
Content-Length: 235

{
  "detail": "URL parameter 'scopeQ' was not part of the query that created entity map 'REGEX(.*)'",
  "status": 400,
  "title": "Bad Request",
  "type": "https://uri.etsi.org/ngsi-ld/errors/BadRequestData"
}



10. Mutate urn:V2 speed -> 5 (now fails the bound q=speed>15)
============================================================
HTTP/1.1 204 No Content
Date: REGEX(.*)




11. Reuse OMITTING params — bound q re-applied live, V2 now drops, only V3
==========================================================================
    Map still has 2 entries (count=2), but the live re-filter strips V2.
HTTP/1.1 200 OK
Date: REGEX(.*)
Content-Type: application/json
NGSILD-Results-Count: 2
Link: <https://uri.etsi.org/ngsi-ld/v1/ngsi-ld-core-context-v1.9.jsonld>; rel="http://www.w3.org/ns/json-ld#context"; type="application/ld+json"
Content-Length: 120

[
  {
    "id": "urn:V3",
    "speed": {
      "type": "Property",
      "value": 30
    },
    "type": "Vehicle"
  }
]



--TEARDOWN--
swBrokerStop
